OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FHot
OL,6,For very hot through this period with
OL,7,Fthe heat peaking for most on Thursday.
OL,8,FSome uncomfortably warm nights too,
OL,9,Fespecially in towns and cities.
OL,10,FStaying dry and mainly sunny.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
